'''Merc''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be unlocked as a [[Daily Bonus|Stamp Reward]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] increases her health and [[Critical Hit]] chance, and shortens her cooldown and backswing.

